        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 BED   2 BATH   54sqm   2nd FLR   ELECTRIC HEATING  C2    WOODEN DG WINDOWS\r\nDESIGNATED PARKING   SUPERB LOCATION\r\nNB: SEE VIRTUAL TOUR\r\n64 Ridge Hall is a charming 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom 1st floor apartment, boasting a cozy and practical living space with a total area of 54 square meters. Nestled in a prime location, the apartment presents an ideal blend of comfort and convenience.\r\nThe living quarters are thoughtfully designed, offering two well-appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms to accommodate modern living needs. The interior layout reflects a harmonious balance between functionality and aesthetic appeal, providing residents with a comfortable retreat to call home.\r\nOne of the standout features of this residence is its impressive Building Energy Rating (BER) of C2, indicative of good energy efficiency, contributing to a more sustainable and cost-effective lifestyle.\r\nThe location of 64 Ridge Hall is truly exceptional, being only minutes away from the picturesque Killiney Beach, allowing residents to enjoy leisurely strolls along the shore or simply soak in the breathtaking coastal views. The proximity to the DART station ensures effortless connectivity for those who rely on public transportation, while the immediate vicinity offers a diverse array of local shops, services, and amenities, all within a convenient two-minute walk.\r\nFor those seeking a vibrant social scene and an abundance of dining and shopping options, Dalkey Village is a short drive away. The village presents an extensive choice of pubs, restaurants, and shops, adding a touch of vibrancy to the local lifestyle.\r\nTransportation is made easy with excellent connectivity options, including the nearby N11 dual carriageway with its Quality Bus Corridor (Q.B.C.), the M50 motorway, Killiney DART station, Luas, and a local bus service connecting to Dun Laoghaire.\r\nIn summary, 61 Ridge Hall offers not only a comfortable and well-designed living space but also the luxury of a location that provides easy access to the beach, public transportation, local amenities, and the lively offerings of Dalkey Village. This apartment is a delightful combination of modern living and the convenience of a well-connected neighbourhood."
